# Audio Maker pipeline output caches & transient uploads
out_temp/
out_temp_*/
out_test/
out_test_*/
data/uploads/*
!data/uploads/.gitkeep
data/output/*
!data/output/.gitkeep
# The scoreboard and the frozen fixture set are EVIDENCE, not output dumps:
# every measured claim in docs/res_research.md points at a row of the
# scoreboard, and the fixtures are the only way to reproduce those rows
# (the source tracks themselves are not versioned).
!data/output/scoreboard.json
!data/output/_fixtures/
!data/output/_fixtures/*.wav
# The baseline and after ledgers are the citation behind every number. The
# rendered WAVs and equation dumps beside them are reproducible outputs, so
# they stay ignored. NB: the patterns must not prune the directory itself -
# git does not descend into an excluded directory, so a later negation for a
# file inside it would never be reached.
!data/output/_scoreboard/
data/output/_scoreboard/**/*.wav
data/output/_scoreboard/**/*.txt

